    {
      "name": "form.check",
      "kind": "invoke",
      "description": "Dry run: fill and validate a fresh in-memory return. Saves and opens nothing. With `stored: true` the check runs on the return saved for the period instead, which must still be a Draft: once that return has left Draft the check is refused. `ask` lists boxes whose saved answer is dropped when `fields` leaves them unanswered.",
